Well, the tamenes value is decreased by one for every time you're on a
different level for 150 turns. Zero or negative tameness means it goes
peaceful or hostile. So if you return within 150 turns, nothing happens.
If your pet has positive tameness (up to 20), you can return every 300
turns to halve the speed at which it goes feral, etc. Feed it some stuff
while you're visiting it, and you're on the save side.

